{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Welcome to the Town of Zoz</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/Welcome_to_Zoz.gif?t=1741818627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After receiving a letter from his parents, Ito reluctantly returns home to help the family farm and restaurant. As he settles back into family life, Ito realizes that the once peaceful village hides an ancient secret, and the town needs his help to reveal its forbidden past, and the dark cloud that haunts them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Fight with Flavor</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/Fight_With_Flavor.gif?t=1741818627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore the area around Zoz and help the townspeople, take advantage of Ito\u2019s skills with his trusty machete as you slash and dodge through enemies while teaming up with several trusted companions. Each one uses their own unique skills to dispatch enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>True Soul Food</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/True_Soul_Food.gif?t=1741818627\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Food is the way to people\u2019s hearts in Zoz, and giving townsfolk their favorite meal will increase your bonds and allow you to learn more about them. Or eat the meals yourself to gain powerful stat boosts for your next hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>It Takes A Village</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/It_Takes_A_Village.gif?t=1741818627\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone has a story to tell, and it\u2019s up to Ito\u2019s mastering of the soul-infused machete and his magic-infused recipes to help them overcome their personal nightmares. Help legendary town heroes, fashionable shopkeepers, stars of the Boonbola team, leaders of a local magical sect, and speak with a Soulsmith who is able to imbue magic into weapons and tools.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1748110?t=1741818627","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/c056cbace79ea92fcd61fb7bd243063a312427ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741818627","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/42ff223f42c7a7b89b8cc5fcf44e3a421d25dd2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741818627","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/42ff223f42c7a7b89b8cc5fcf44e3a421d25dd2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741818627","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Welcome to the Town of Zoz</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/Welcome_to_Zoz.gif?t=1741818627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After receiving a letter from his parents, Ito reluctantly returns home to help the family farm and restaurant. As he settles back into family life, Ito realizes that the once peaceful village hides an ancient secret, and the town needs his help to reveal its forbidden past, and the dark cloud that haunts them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Fight with Flavor</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/Fight_With_Flavor.gif?t=1741818627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore the area around Zoz and help the townspeople, take advantage of Ito\u2019s skills with his trusty machete as you slash and dodge through enemies while teaming up with several trusted companions. Each one uses their own unique skills to dispatch enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>True Soul Food</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/True_Soul_Food.gif?t=1741818627\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Food is the way to people\u2019s hearts in Zoz, and giving townsfolk their favorite meal will increase your bonds and allow you to learn more about them. Or eat the meals yourself to gain powerful stat boosts for your next hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>It Takes A Village</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/extras/It_Takes_A_Village.gif?t=1741818627\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone has a story to tell, and it\u2019s up to Ito\u2019s mastering of the soul-infused machete and his magic-infused recipes to help them overcome their personal nightmares. Help legendary town heroes, fashionable shopkeepers, stars of the Boonbola team, leaders of a local magical sect, and speak with a Soulsmith who is able to imbue magic into weapons and tools.</p>","developers":["Studio Pixanoh"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1748110/c8116ba0e01df27e114f2c67ea36de9d9d1c38c0/header.jpg?t=1741818627","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025. Humble Bundle and Humble Games are among the registered trademarks of Ziff Davis LLC, parent company of Humble Bundle Inc. throughout the world. All rights reserved. Any unauthorized use of such trademarks is expressly prohibited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113517,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113517/movie480.mp4?t=1741818625","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113517/movie_max.mp4?t=1741818625"},"name":"Town_of_Zoz_Announce","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113517/d7f969cf3c54070d74d153d72b10e5d3423050c4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741818625","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113517/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741818625","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113517/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741818625"}}],"name":"Town of Zoz","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> tbd</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> tbd</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Humble Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptor